Chapter: CharAtPastEnd
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Before the guard this read into the next allocation: with a neighbour
 filled with `Z`, char-code-at at index 20 on a five-byte text answered 64.

Section: Entry

  s : Text = "abcde"

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("got=" & show (char-code-at s (text-length s)))
  end

